# Attestation Generation Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start([HR User starts process]) --> Login{User logged in?}
    Login -->|No| Auth[Login/Signup]
    Auth --> Login
    Login -->|Yes| SelectEmp[Select Employee]
    
    SelectEmp --> LoadTypes[Load Dynamic Attestation Types]
    LoadTypes --> SelectType[Select Attestation Type]
    SelectType --> Validate{Valid selection?}
    
    Validate -->|No| Error1[Show error message]
    Error1 --> SelectType
    Validate -->|Yes| Generate[Generate Attestation]
    
    Generate --> GetTemplate[Get JRXML Template from DB]
    GetTemplate --> TemplateExists{Template exists?}
    TemplateExists -->|No| Error2[Template not found error]
    Error2 --> SelectType
    TemplateExists -->|Yes| CompileTemplate[Compile JRXML Template]
    
    CompileTemplate --> FillTemplate[Fill template with employee data]
    FillTemplate --> GeneratePDF[Generate PDF using JasperReports]
    GeneratePDF --> SaveFile[Save PDF to file system]
    SaveFile --> SaveRecord[Save attestation record to DB]
    SaveRecord --> Success[Show success notification]
    
    Success --> Download{Download PDF?}
    Download -->|Yes| DownloadFile[Download generated PDF]
    Download -->|No| End([Process complete])
    DownloadFile --> End
    
    %% Styling
    classDef startEnd fill:#e1f5fe
    classDef process fill:#f3e5f5
    classDef decision fill:#fff3e0
    classDef error fill:#ffebee
    
    class Start,End startEnd
    class Auth,SelectEmp,LoadTypes,SelectType,Generate,GetTemplate,CompileTemplate,FillTemplate,GeneratePDF,SaveFile,SaveRecord,Success,DownloadFile process
    class Login,Validate,TemplateExists,Download decision
    class Error1,Error2 error
```